{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "daa5da6dff6d46fe58e0065f01b9cf8659f6c7bf7b5e42a5efd8cdd72a331152", "ja": "（紅白歌祭りの撤収作業が、ようやく終わった。最後に\nもう一度、忘れ物がないか客席を見て帰ろう……）", "zh": "（红白歌祭的撤场工作总算结束了。最后再去观众席看看有没有忘记什么东西，然后就回去吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "438dd240323b9f0103764866845aa01b3ab0c6c5d6f764d1160b1c5e9fa884c2", "ja": "{$P$}さん♪\nえへへ、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生♪\n嘿嘿，辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "118e5b5584490a71ce71085b8655be12f630426ce4a0ebeb43cf80dbddfc24c4", "ja": "あれ、未来？　まだ残ってたのか。", "zh": "咦，未来？你还没走啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "b14edef2f1a9196ca7d9032287338041dae2f3333a24edab435343fad155ac02", "ja": "はい！　帰ろうかなーって思ったんですけど、\n{$P$}さん、お仕事終わるかなって。", "zh": "是的！我本来想着差不多该回去了，不过在想，{$P$}先生的工作不知道什么时候能结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9f1233920dc0054766f7a5e7a23ba462787660ec1be506b6d332aae426bf955b", "ja": "何か用事があったのか？", "zh": "你是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "f9bdef9844dc2e9b9c7d0753dea9a80a1e6b7d47c83e00b3a771f99e5e3f7cd9", "ja": "特別、用事があるってわけじゃないんですけど……\n今日のライブが楽しかったから、話したかったんです！", "zh": "倒也不是有什么特别的事……\n只是因为今天的演出很开心，所以想和您聊聊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "0e1b09608199a20ab491230f2097c4939d5953533f718ef03fce20bc49a1df2c", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n今日のライブって、楽しかったですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n今天的演唱会，您觉得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e317e8b7ce5b995e5731bae7dd5e2fdbcc77a186fbe333ebf0f6f8d61fbdd953", "ja": "そうだな、みんな楽しそうだったよ。\nお客さんにとっても、いいライブだったと思う。", "zh": "是啊，大家看起来都很开心。\n我觉得对观众来说，这也是一场很棒的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "915700c09641a223497b0051313abe08e94cb3f2c5da4ba36a4bda93d40ec2fa", "ja": "はい！　お客さんたち、みんなニコニコしてましたね！\nコールもいっぱい返してくれたし♪", "zh": "是的！客人们全都笑眯眯的呢！\n也回应了好多欢呼声♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "3fefcbc859debe61ae381a2d297a18cf11e52b8b3ab9cbadf701f3ef9a605a1f", "ja": "あ、じゃなくて！　えっと。\n{$P$}さんは、楽しかったですか？", "zh": "啊，不是！那个……{$P$}先生，您玩得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f789e4a23bb57f53cbe07d2ca3fb2c4c885420b1f6ec20b14253e56f02a8bc60", "ja": "未来は、俺が楽しかったかどうかが、\nそんなに気になるのか？", "zh": "未来就这么在意我开不开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "f79c280c51261b36d10d8cee0f6e7a6b38538e9d5e2a3d32339784680f16595b", "ja": "はい、気になります！\nとっても、とーっても気になりますよ！", "zh": "是的，我很在意！\n非常、非——常在意哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "72ed2989b6faf9a727dfd5384dc72aff75fc6908fe919d04280a53ab15f83b12", "ja": "ライブの時って、ステージがキラキラで、楽しくて。\n「これって夢なのかな？」って思うことがあるんです。", "zh": "演出会时，舞台闪闪发光的，又开心。有时我会想：“这是不是梦呢？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "25300f6db261e88526a27d5bdc6a72f77f742e20b3a18444871cea67bd053a42", "ja": "でも{$P$}さんが「楽しかった」って\n言ってくれるなら、本当かもな～って。だから……。", "zh": "不过，如果{$P$}先生说“很开心”，我就会觉得这或许是真的吧～所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5b6267d91b604cb9369792da3ca98c99eaf69298e47b76c35ec121cea68695b8", "ja": "そうか。じゃあ、ちゃんと言おうかな。\nすごく楽しいライブだったぞ、未来！", "zh": "这样啊。那我就好好说出来吧。\n这是一场非常开心的演唱会，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "eaae98eab5096bdd576d6bfc8e2e3c1766bc4579bebf79ff5088f47c090cba42", "ja": "{$P$}さん……でへへへへ。\nはい！　私も、すっごく楽しかったです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿嘿嘿。\n嗯！我也觉得特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "e30228cc318dd9a61b00f3fc53a5ab4806fa0ff40c9820c46570eadeb19a8d04", "ja": "夢じゃなくてよかった～！\n夢じゃなくて……あれ？　あれ～……？", "zh": "太好了，这不是在做梦～！\n不是做梦……咦？咦～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d460c0687e922469315e82bb9a51fa61701890d2a519be115b3a4a14c8acb407", "ja": "どうかしたのか、未来？", "zh": "怎么了，未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "f9dc64b35ffc30dc2cafc4ad26e644ef0bb301e8bc3356e29a618918558476c4", "ja": "どうしよう……夢っていっぱい言ってたら、\nなんか不安になってきちゃいました～！", "zh": "怎么办……一直把梦想挂在嘴边，\n不知怎么的，突然开始不安起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "06c51be0cab001d99b973e7238e3e575a07e7afecbc3ccc3cb02b00271c35473", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　私って、\n劇場のアイドルですよね？　夢じゃないですよね！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！我可是剧场的偶像，对吧？不是在做梦吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0524b6a35bb116f7c0841bbcb9ba9d698ce21a6d94688fae539f8834acd5b311", "ja": "そんなに心配しなくても大丈夫。\n未来は、ちゃんと劇場のアイドルだよ。", "zh": "不用那么担心，没事的。\n未来确实是剧场的偶像哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "dd0bec19900f1845a332dfdd3236314b6b259e435da3aa16fc30c913e033be08", "ja": "そうですよね！\nはぁ、よかった～……。", "zh": "对吧！\n哈，太好了～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "03214b598e0f554db2a5e4f6d3b4b12a5181a0fc33ca1740d3bdeeafb4d64547", "ja": "{$P$}さん。また私が心配に\nなっちゃったら、教えてくださいね！　えへへ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生。如果我又开始担心了，请告诉我哦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0163_1023_p", "source_sha256": "ca10a73b86a4de8bf9022b77dffdc5e3478f95fa3e0dca2b06d16422f35c0cf7", "ja": "（しっかりしてきたような、そうでもないような……\n色んな意味で、まだまだ、目が離せないな！）", "zh": "（感觉她好像越来越可靠了，又好像不是……不管从哪方面来说，都还差得远，真是不能放松视线啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
